 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** Linear with respect to the number of rays and samples per ray [S1]. The rendering pipeline iterates over poses, making total time proportional to the number of poses [S2, unofficial].
-- **Memory Complexity:** Proportional to `BATCH_SIZE * H * W * NUM_SAMPLES` for storing intermediate tensors (predictions, alpha, transmittance, weights) [S1]. The `chunk` parameter in the pipeline limits peak memory usage by processing rays in batches [S2, unofficial].
-- **Performance:** Depends heavily on hardware acceleration (GPU) for matrix operations and cumulative products [S1]. Downsampling (`render_factor`) significantly reduces computation time for previews [S2, unofficial].
